e Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">COMPONENTS.md says helps = accent/primary, hurts = status/warning. The source fills every bar text/secondary so colour never reads as good or bad. Source followed.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
